== 1. grant
$ adb shell am force-stop io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example
$ adb shell appops set io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW allow
$ adb shell appops get io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW
SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW: allow; time=+502ms ago; duration=0
$ adb shell am start -n io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example/.MainActivity
ok: The bubble is off.
== 2. start the window host
$ adb shell input tap 540 1457
ok: The bubble is on.
shot: 01-started.png
bubble frame: [933,1127][1080,1274]
== 3. drag and snap
$ adb shell input keyevent 3
before drag: [933,1127][1080,1274]
$ adb shell input swipe 1006 1200 300 900 800
after drop at 300,900: [0,826][147,973]
shot: 02-snapped-left.png
== 4. tap: the panel opens, the bubble hides
$ adb shell input tap 73 899
ok: Opened from the bubble.
bubble frame while panel open: ''
shot: 03-panel-open.png
== 5. close the panel: the bubble returns
$ adb shell input tap 540 2249
bubble frame after close: [0,826][147,973]
shot: 04-panel-closed.png
== 6. taps() lists the tap, no text
$ adb shell am start -n io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example/.MainActivity
Warning: Activity not started, its current task has been brought to the front
$ adb shell input tap 540 1623
ok: "action":"tap"
tap log: [{"app":"io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example","at":1790703670189,"action":"tap"}]
shot: 05-taps.png
== 7. focused field via the example's accessibility service, read in another app
$ adb shell settings put secure enabled_accessibility_services io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example/io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example.a11y.DemoAccessibilityService
$ adb shell settings put secure accessibility_enabled 1
$ adb shell am start -a android.intent.action.INSERT -t vnd.android.cursor.dir/contact
$ adb shell input tap 540 1486
$ adb shell input text hello%sbubble
focused field: text="hello bubble" class="android.widget.EditText" package="com.google.android.contacts"
bubble frame (above the keyboard): [0,826][147,973]
$ adb shell input swipe 73 899 73 899 1200
shot: 06-field-read-said.png
focus kept: text="hello bubble"
$ adb shell am start -n io.github.umeranjum17.byokit.example/.MainActivity
Warning: Activity not started, its current task has been brought to the front
ok: available: true
ok: "text":"hello bubble"
field: available: true, read: {"app":"com.google.android.contacts","text":"hello bubble","selection":{"start":12,"end":12}}
shot: 07-field-in-app.png
